Please create a class performing checks on correctness of all the *.svi files in the project.
Input - a list of full paths to SVI files.
For now, let it be one check:
- If several *.svi files have the same destination file (target path after resolution)
Then output error about it. 
Output format example:
-------
Error: Multiple SVI files are configured to generate the same destination file: 'C:\temp\test.js':
- C:\temp\test.svi
- C:\temp\test2.svi
----
The error is critical because a file can be overwritten. With a big probability,
it can happen due to a human error